  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Cut capsicum and carrot into bite-sized chunks.\n• Place veggies on the lined oven tray. Sprinkle with chermoula spice blend, season with salt and drizzle with olive oil.\n• Toss to coat and roast until tender, 20-25 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69bcf457b1c7102b607e2077/step-9f347600.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Boil the kettle.\n• Pat haloumi dry, then cut into 1cm-thick slices (you should get 3 pieces per person).\n• In a medium frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook haloumi until golden brown, 2 mins each side. Cook haloumi in batches for the best results.\n• Remove pan from heat, add honey and a splash of water and turn haloumi to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69bcf457b1c7102b607e2077/step-42a65910.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, combine the water and stock powder in a medium saucepan and bring to the boil.\n• Add couscous and the butter and stir to combine. Cover with a lid and remove from heat.\n• Set aside until the water has absorbed, 5 mins. Fluff up with fork.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69bcf457b1c7102b607e2077/step-2d398820.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Add the roasted veggies and baby spinach to the couscous. Toss to coat. Season to taste.\n• Divide roast veggie couscous and haloumi between bowls. Top with yoghurt to serve.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/69bcf457b1c7102b607e2077/step-d6adec30.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
